{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Oakhaven! That hot and sultry landscape with bayous that twist and turn, cypress trees that rise from the water draped in Spanish moss that whisper secrets from long ago and where storytelling is a way of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a remake from the original 2006 game. This new version has been updated to use professional voice acting, some updated graphics, and some new animations. Enjoy going back to the days of traditional point and click games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is about two cousins who get a letter from their grandmother, beckoning them to come home to Oakhaven because she has an important message for them. You will play as both characters, Daphne and Dominic. You will have puzzles to solve and in the process discover the tragic family history.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Traditional Point and Click Adventure Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand Painted Digital Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professional Voice Actors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Southern Style Rooms to Explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Southern Style Music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Many Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a Boat through the Swamp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn About Bayou Voodoo and Meet a Swamp Witch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a Tarot Card Reading</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Dark Secrets from the Past</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993490?t=1759098677","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993490?t=1759098677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993490/ff3ec1157f87899a1199464a37cd8c083b20d3c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759098677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993490/ff3ec1157f87899a1199464a37cd8c083b20d3c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759098677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Oakhaven! That hot and sultry landscape with bayous that twist and turn, cypress trees that rise from the water draped in Spanish moss that whisper secrets from long ago and where storytelling is a way of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a remake from the original 2006 game. This new version has been updated to use professional voice acting, some updated graphics, and some new animations. Enjoy going back to the days of traditional point and click games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is about two cousins who get a letter from their grandmother, beckoning them to come home to Oakhaven because she has an important message for them. You will play as both characters, Daphne and Dominic. You will have puzzles to solve and in the process discover the tragic family history.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Traditional Point and Click Adventure Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand Painted Digital Graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Professional Voice Actors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Southern Style Rooms to Explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Southern Style Music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Many Puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a Boat through the Swamp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn About Bayou Voodoo and Meet a Swamp Witch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a Tarot Card Reading</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Dark Secrets from the Past</p>","developers":["Cindy Pondillo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993490/e823400ef0ff787d266b525f4f964faa31964cd3/header.jpg?t=1759098677","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993490/1366162503/16b288f73cf3dff352320fbb5dfa7c74e972f333/1759097096/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759098667","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993490/1366162503/16b288f73cf3dff352320fbb5dfa7c74e972f333/1759097096/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759098667","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993490/1366162503/16b288f73cf3dff352320fbb5dfa7c74e972f333/1759097096/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759098667","id":257208167,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208167/movie480.mp4?t=1759098667","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208167/movie_max.mp4?t=1759098667"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208167/85f909a60ae8b441c52e96f8109ce40f9187377f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759098667","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208167/movie480.webm?t=1759098667","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208167/movie_max.webm?t=1759098667"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993490/1869141034/b9539629cf625a8607194b7d46836463cf4fddae/1756696048/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758898688","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993490/1869141034/b9539629cf625a8607194b7d46836463cf4fddae/1756696048/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758898688","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3993490/186914103